        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `stream_microphone.py` that streams microphone audio and yields interim transcripts using a concrete external provider, I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. This API is identifiable by the import of `google.cloud.speech` and the use of the `SpeechClient` class. </thinking>\n",
